<title>UK: Ship carrying edible oil on fire at Russian port.</title>
<headline>Ship carrying edible oil on fire at Russian port.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-06-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Maltese-flag vessel Tivat, berthed at St Petersburg, has a fire in a hold which is loaded with edible oil, Lloyds Shipping Intelligence Service said.</p>
<p>The 14,114 dwt vessel arrived at the Russian port from Buenos Aires.</p>
</text>
